\par\par \b \uc2 Business News: \uc2 Stellantis\uc2  to Delay Illinois Plant Plans\b0\par\par\uc2 By Denny Jacob \par \uc2 261 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 August 2024\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B3\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Chrysler parent \uc2 Stellantis\uc2  said it would delay its plans for an assembly plant in Belvidere, Ill., and added that it remains committed to the endeavor.\par \par \uc2 The maker of \uc2 Jeep\uc2 , Dodge and a dozen other brands said it hasn't violated commitments that were part of a collective bargaining agreement with the \uc2 United Auto Workers union\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "In fact, the \uc2 UAW\uc2  agreed to language that expressly allows the company to modify product investments and employment levels," \uc2 Stellantis\uc2  said Tuesday. "Therefore, the union cannot legally strike over a violation of this letter at this time."\par \par \uc2 The union on Monday said several local units representing workers at \uc2 Stellantis\uc2  are prepared to file grievances over what it described as the company's failure to keep its investment commitments and honor the contract, "paving the way for a national strike at \uc2 Stellantis\uc2 , if necessary."\par \par \uc2 UAW\uc2  didn't respond to a request for comment on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The union has garnered attention in recent months after battling for a new contract with automakers.\par \par \uc2 The efforts resulted in workers at \uc2 General Motors\uc2 , \uc2 Ford Motor\uc2  and \uc2 Stellantis\uc2  ratifying four-year contracts, which secured the return of cost-of-living adjustments, a 25% base-wage increase, the right to strike over plant closures and other gains.\par \par \uc2 As part of the labor deal, the \uc2 UAW\uc2  secured the reopening of a 1,350-employee Jeep assembly plant in Belvidere. The plant, which \uc2 Stellantis\uc2  idled indefinitely in 2023, will make midsize trucks, and an adjoining battery facility will be constructed there, the union has said.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020240821ek8l0003a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
